		{
			description: [
				"A millstone. Yes, really."
				""
				"Machinery is not beneath us and it is not the point either. It is a faster way to break a thing into smaller things, and from here the ladder uses it."
				""
				"Build it before the era asks. Nothing downstream of this works without it."
			]
